{"h":"<p>这是一个基于LCM的ComfyUI工作流程<a href=\"https://github.com/0xbitches/ComfyUI-LCM#latent-consistency-model-for-comfyui-\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">ComfyUI 的潜在一致性模型</a></p><p>最新的 comfyui 更新中已经支持 LCM，此工作流程支持多模型合并，并且生成速度超快。</p><p>为了使其正常工作，您需要安装这些自定义节点。::</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/RockOfFire/ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">Comfyroll客户节点</a></p><p>需要这个lora，放在lora文件夹下</p><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/latent-consistency/lcm-lora-sdxl/tree/main\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>潜在一致性模型 (LCM) LoRA：SDXL</strong></a></p><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/latent-consistency/lcm-lora-sdv1-5/tree/main\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>潜在一致性模型 (LCM) LoRA：SDv1-5</strong></a></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/08334ff6-9d4a-48bf-8adb-9bfa9230ed74/width=525/08334ff6-9d4a-48bf-8adb-9bfa9230ed74.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/072e68e1-b8fb-4980-8263-323e38039129/width=525/072e68e1-b8fb-4980-8263-323e38039129.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>希望你们喜欢它...！</p>","lang":"en","v":2,"o":{"en":"<p>This is a ComfyUI workflow base on LCM<a href=\"https://github.com/0xbitches/ComfyUI-LCM#latent-consistency-model-for-comfyui-\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">Latent Consistency Model for ComfyUI</a></p><p>LCM is already supported in the latest comfyui update this worflow support multi model merge and is super fast generation.</p><p>For this to work correctly you need those custom node install.::</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/RockOfFire/ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">Comfyroll custome node</a></p><p>Need this lora and place it in the lora folder</p><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/latent-consistency/lcm-lora-sdxl/tree/main\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>Latent Consistency Model (LCM) LoRA: SDXL</strong></a></p><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/latent-consistency/lcm-lora-sdv1-5/tree/main\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>Latent Consistency Model (LCM) LoRA: SDv1-5</strong></a></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/08334ff6-9d4a-48bf-8adb-9bfa9230ed74/width=525/08334ff6-9d4a-48bf-8adb-9bfa9230ed74.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/072e68e1-b8fb-4980-8263-323e38039129/width=525/072e68e1-b8fb-4980-8263-323e38039129.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>Hope you people like it...!</p>"}}